    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to aid Era-bus in its relentless quest for vengeance and consume everything in your path? Download now and experience the beginning of an epic cosmic revenge saga in<strong>\u00a0<i>Singularity Strike!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of destruction with intuitive controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directional Arrows: Navigate Erebus across the vast expanse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Aim with precision and wreak havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse 1: Fire your primary weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse 2: Activate the devastating Black Hole Bomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong Narrative: Follow the quest of Era-bus on a mission to take revenge on the humanoids thats kept it captive. Uncover the secrets of BCAT - Blackhole Consciouness Acquisition Theory...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Unique Weapons: Customize your devastation with a variety of weaponry, each with unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five\u00a0Levels: Explore and dominate the GN-z11 Galaxy while experiencing a unique Sci-Fi narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
